  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Partnership for Resilient and Inclusive Small Livestock Markets Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of PRISM is to reduce poverty by empowering poor rural men, women and youth to participate in the transformation of the Rwanda livestock sector and to enhance their resilience. The programme development objective is to improve food and nutritional security and the incomes of poor rural households through better performance of the value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
